SUMMARY:KELS - Dirty Blues Princess Tour
LOCATION:Brighton Music Hall\, 158 Brighton Ave\, Boston\, MA 02134
DESCRIPTION:THIS EVENT IS ALL AGES. | DOORS: 7:00 PM / SHOW: 8:00 PM. | ALL
  TIMES AND SUPPORT BANDS ARE SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE OR REFUND. O
 riginally from Pittsburgh\, KELS built her career from the ground up?she m
 oved to Atlanta and started cleaning houses by day to fund her music caree
 r\, writing songs between jobs\, and playing anywhere and everywhere she c
 ould including busking on the street. KELS created her own path. She promo
 ted individual songs through hundreds of original posts\, sometimes sharin
 g as many as 500 pieces of content around a single record. She then took h
 er music directly to fans\, independently booking\, funding\, promoting\, 
 and managing a 52-show U.S.?Secret Show? tour without a label or managemen
 t support. What began with a living-room performance for five people grew 
 into sold-out shows across the country. With the release of her entirely s
 elf-written debut EP\, Dirty Blues Princess\, KELS has emerged as one of m
 usic?s most exciting genre-defying new voices.\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.c
 om/kels-dirty-blues-princess-tour-boston-massachusetts-10-11-2026/event/01
 00650AABE4BE94\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/kels-dirty-blues-princess-tour-boston-mass
 achusetts-10-11-2026/event/0100650AABE4BE94
END:VEVENT
